bind Plan Event: Event ID, Budget
bind Book Venue: Event ID, Venue
bind Send Invitations: Event ID, Number of Guests, Invitation Status
bind Arrange Catering: Event ID, Catering Service
bind Hire Staff: Event ID, Staff Role
bind Set Up Venue: Event ID
bind Conduct Rehearsal: Event ID, Rehearsal ID
bind Welcome Guests: Event ID
bind Facilitate Activities: Event ID
bind Deliver Speech: Event ID
bind Serve Meals: Event ID, Catering Service
bind Coordinate Photography: Event ID
bind Distribute Gifts: Event ID
bind Collect Feedback: Event ID, Venue
bind Tear Down Venue: Event ID
Event ID: integer between None and None
Budget: float between 0.0 and 1000000.0
Venue: Hall A, Hall B, Hall C
Number of Guests: integer between 1 and 10000
Invitation Status: Sent, Pending, Confirmed
Catering Service: Buffet, Sit-down Dinner, Cocktail
Staff Role: Waiter, Coordinator, Cleaner
Rehearsal ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Init[Plan Event] | |
End[Tear Down Venue] | |
Precedence[Book Venue, Plan Event] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Send Invitations, Book Venue] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Arrange Catering, Send Invitations] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Hire Staff, Arrange Catering] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Set Up Venue, Hire Staff] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Conduct Rehearsal, Set Up Venue] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Welcome Guests, Conduct Rehearsal] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Facilitate Activities, Welcome Guests] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Deliver Speech, Facilitate Activities] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Serve Meals, Deliver Speech] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Coordinate Photography, Serve Meals] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Distribute Gifts, Coordinate Photography] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Collect Feedback, Distribute Gifts] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |
Precedence[Tear Down Venue, Collect Feedback] | |A.Event ID == T.Event ID |